  "body": "Titles and CCCs are issued, and the homes are ready to move into now.\r\nIf you've been searching for a brand-new home in the Bays but want something with better quality, 23A Channel View Road deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nProfessionally designed interiors, warm natural materials and thoughtful detailing give this home a character that can be felt the moment you walk in. Stylish yet welcoming, it has been designed for real everyday living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n* Brand-new freehold standalone home\r\n* Approx. 173m² floor area on 187m² of land, PLUS approx. 13m² of deck -- total 186m2\r\n* Three bathrooms plus guest powder room\r\n* Professionally designed interiors\r\n* Designer kitchen with quality appliances and finishes\r\n* Smart switches controlled by APPs throughout the home\r\n* Full central air conditioning\r\n* CCTV and video doorbell\r\n* Internal-access garage\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor connection\r\n* Landscaped, low-maintenance outdoor living\r\n* Sought-after Campbells Bay location\r\n\r\nPerfect For\r\n\r\nYoung and growing families, professional couples and buyers looking to step into a quality standalone home in the Bays.\r\n\r\nHere you can enjoy the simplicity of brand-new living without giving up the independence and feeling of having a home of your own.\r\n\r\nCome and experience it in person. The difference is in the details.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewing contacting: \r\nJacky Yu - 0212333771\r\nAriel Wang  - 0273893436",
